{"status":true,"data":{"id":74,"name":"BuildShare","slug":"buildshare","mod_id":"BuildShare","shortDescription":"Share your buildings with the world.","description":"## Introducing Build Share open alpha. Create building prefabs and import them as  blueprints\r\n\r\n\r\nIn the open alpha uploading is not yet supported. For the full release a complete website is planned to browse the buildings online. Uploading and downloading buildings from other people will be possible from in-game.\r\nThe current version is available as an open alpha to test the general blueprint creation. You can still share your buildings by sharing the files in the `Sons Of The Forest/Mods/BuildShare/LocalBuildings` folder.\r\n\r\nThe default key to bring up the panel is `Page Up`, you can change it in the in-game settings (Mods -> BuildShare -> Toggle Key).\r\nYou can cancel any action (building selection or placing) with the Escape key.\r\n\r\nPlacing a building has two modes (which you can switch between with the right mouse button).\r\n\r\nCorner Mode: Align the building with with the terrain but trying to keep each lower corner of the building above the ground. Change the height offset with scroll.\r\n\r\nFree Mode: Freely place the building anywhere. Change the distance with scroll.","dependencies":"","type":"Mod","modSide":null,"isNSFW":false,"isApproved":true,"isFeatured":false,"isMultiplayerCompatible":false,"requiresAllPlayers":false,"lastWeekDownloads":113,"downloads":23350,"latestVersion":"1.0.10","latestVersionSize":"","averageRating":0,"reviewsCount":0,"favoritesCount":2,"commentsCount":2,"sourceUrl":null,"imageUrl":"https://r2.sotf-mods.com/1767666383118_1702916367133_buildshare_thumbnail.png","buildGuid":null,"buildShareVersion":null,"numberOfElements":null,"lastReleasedAt":"2025-01-29T23:36:38.853Z","createdAt":"2023-12-18T16:19:27.103Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-29T03:30:00.579Z","userId":8,"categoryId":1,"images":[],"user":{"name":"ToniMacaroni","slug":"tonimacaroni","imageUrl":""